---
source: crates/agentgateway/src/import/litellm.rs
description: src/tests/import/litellm/db-state-mcp-allow-all-keys-mismatch.yaml
---
source: litellm
config:
  config:
    database:
      url: "sqlite://data.db"
  gateways:
    default:
      port: 4000
  ui:
    gateways: default
  llm:
    gateways: default
    models:
      - name: chat
        provider: openAI
        params:
          model: gpt-4o
    policies:
      apiKey:
        keys:
          - key: sk-test-master-key
            metadata:
              name: master
          - keyHash: "sha256:0dd3257810ad16825f75bcec4d14dfc15959c5cc29f40cf319c4b327533b8449"
            metadata:
              name: observer
        mode: strict
findings:
  - sourcePath: "model_list[0]"
    status: exact
    message: Imported model deployment for chat
  - sourcePath: general_settings.master_key
    status: approximate
    message: "Mapped LiteLLM's master_key (an admin-equivalent credential, not a per-user virtual key) to strict Authorization Bearer authentication; LiteLLM also accepts other credential headers. Per-user virtual-key migration needs LiteLLM's database state, not config.yaml alone."
  - sourcePath: mcp_servers.yaml_open_db_closed
    status: approximate
    message: "Renamed \"yaml_open_db_closed\" to \"yaml-open-db-closed\" to satisfy agentgateway's Gateway-API-style MCP target name pattern (lowercase letters, digits, '-', '.'; no underscores)"
  - sourcePath: mcp_servers.yaml_open_db_closed
    status: approximate
    message: "Mapped LiteLLM MCP server to agentgateway target \"yaml-open-db-closed\""
  - sourcePath: mcp_servers.yaml_closed_db_open
    status: approximate
    message: "Renamed \"yaml_closed_db_open\" to \"yaml-closed-db-open\" to satisfy agentgateway's Gateway-API-style MCP target name pattern (lowercase letters, digits, '-', '.'; no underscores)"
  - sourcePath: mcp_servers.yaml_closed_db_open
    status: unsupported
    message: "This server is restricted to specific virtual keys via DB-managed object_permission.mcp_servers grants, which config.yaml alone cannot express; it was not emitted rather than exposing it to every caller"
  - sourcePath: "db_state.keys[0]"
    status: exact
    message: "Migrated key \"observer\" to llm.policies.apiKey (hash-based, no plaintext)"
  - sourcePath: db_state.mcp_servers.yaml_open_db_closed
    status: approximate
    message: "MCP server \"yaml_open_db_closed\": config.yaml left this server open, but DB-state's allow_all_keys: false disagreed - closed by default, only reachable now via an explicit per-key/per-team grant"
  - sourcePath: db_state.mcp_servers.yaml_closed_db_open
    status: manual
    message: "MCP server \"yaml_closed_db_open\" is open to every key (allow_all_keys) per DB-state, but has no emitted, open agentgateway target to grant access to - check its config.yaml mcp_servers import findings"
